{"title":"1999 AHSME Problems/Problem 19","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Consider all <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Triangle\" title=\"Triangle\">triangles</a> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/a/e2a559986ed5a0ffc5654bd367c29dfc92913c36.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"44\" height=\"14\" /> satisfying in the following conditions: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/a/f3ac37c9fa391eebb9601bfaca8bfbfaabdf5ca1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB = AC$\" width=\"80\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/f/9ffb448918db29f2a72f8f87f421b3b3cad18f95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> is a point on <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/2/5/12517bbc31cb9026c71299b7a0d232d07e60f284.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{AC}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"18\" /> for which <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/3/5/635aaf493927a2a6c0c85d1613ff38840fb6ba42.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{BD} \\perp \\overline{AC}$\" width=\"82\" height=\"15\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/7/a179ff2638e4799cadd820db205c2beff6299ce9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/4/0948661e822f2a953c43a57ac9e40b2734476de4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$CD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" /> are integers, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/3/7/237ec66e204854caf0ae63318e6deec53e0a4a2c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BD^{2} = 57$\" width=\"80\" height=\"15\" />.  Among all such triangles, the smallest possible value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/7/a179ff2638e4799cadd820db205c2beff6299ce9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/d/0/4d08273e2a3ddb2c8fffd607582fa89298ab91db.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] pair A,B,C,D;  A=(5,12); B=origin; C=(10,0); D=(8.52071005917,3.55029585799); draw(A--B--C--cycle); draw(B--D); label(&quot;$A$&quot;,A,N); label(&quot;$B$&quot;,B,SW); label(&quot;$C$&quot;,C,SE); label(&quot;$D$&quot;,D,NE); [/asy]\" width=\"218\" height=\"252\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/9/819a3d52280009bf210e9483357a6b640249eb84.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textrm{(A)} \\ 9 \\qquad \\textrm{(B)} \\ 10 \\qquad \\textrm{(C)} \\ 11 \\qquad \\textrm{(D)} \\ 12 \\qquad \\textrm{(E)} \\ 13$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"369\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/0/a10db5e31f39fea3037fa0481d7690a23daf9f82.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AD = AC - CD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"135\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/a/f3ac37c9fa391eebb9601bfaca8bfbfaabdf5ca1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB = AC$\" width=\"80\" height=\"13\" /> are integers. By the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Pythagorean_Theorem\" title=\"Pythagorean Theorem\">Pythagorean Theorem</a>, \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/b/a/3ba85b5e9b5d2e89a45a9e4d3843ac17664a2818.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[AD^2 + 57 = AB^2 \\Longrightarrow 1 \\cdot 57 = 3 \\cdot 19 = (AB - AD)(AB + AD).\\]\" width=\"478\" height=\"19\" />\n</p><p>Thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/b/0/1b00f5f1a1e441a7a9d681af9a6a0cfadf1d3e0a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AC = AB = \\frac {1 + 57}{2} = 29$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"200\" height=\"37\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/a/89a13051c1f645edcbdec86fe7c4182bd03a2e16.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac {3 + 19}{2} = 11 \\Longrightarrow \\mathrm{(C)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"161\" height=\"37\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_AHSME\" title=\"1999 AHSME\">1999 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1999 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1999 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1999\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_AHSME_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"1999 AHSME Problems/Problem 18\">Problem 18</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20\" tit